    "Temporary switch/depth/default-mode/presence/membership-version changes invalidate the prior proof; rollback restores the exact same valid parent without mutating model input or granting privileges",
    "Nested directory is observed within scope; parent traversal, similar path prefix and a real Windows Junction resolve outside scope and require a separate User permission fact. Missing directory and ordinary file reject",
    "The Junction is created by a hidden local fixture-only PowerShell process using ordinary Windows paths, verified against its real canonical target, then removed without removing the target; original attachment symlink protection remains unchanged",
    "Different original tool-call observations, mismatched directory request, widened write access and external directory plans all reject with no child rows; actual within-parent registration persists the exact observed workspace at depth2",
    "The actual registered nested child enters original Core workspace preparation and claim successfully. Candidate execution workspace equals its persisted scope, rather than the current Camp root",
    "Actual User takeover fences the old parent proof; a genuinely admitted/claimed later User Run gets its own proof with its own execution directory, and explicit Core stop fences that proof",
    "Original identity, frozen policy, runtime lease crypto/replay, member leave/readd binding, ready Mission worktree claim, nine SingleChat owners and Run-local cancellation regressions pass"
  ],
